beautiful stone, sure, but I feel like it seems to be attracted to this big stone...","nextNodeIds":[760090507]},{"nodeId":760090507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4113536634,"text":"Really? Paimon doesn't feel anything at all.","nextNodeIds":[760090508]},{"nodeId":760090508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21839,"speakerName":"Kasha","textMapHash":824818074,"text":"I'm not really sure either... It's just a vague hunch, I guess.","nextNodeIds":[760090509]},{"nodeId":760090509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21839,"speakerName":"Kasha","textMapHash":1776236658,"text":"It's like... how Mai mentioned that Reed Miller encountered the fae princess through the guidance of the Moon Goddess. I guess this premonition of mine must be something similar...?","nextNodeIds":[760090510]},{"nodeId":760090510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":981217498,"text":"Wow, is this what they call foresight? But wait — Paimon's pretty sure the Moon Goddess wouldn't bother with something like that... She's probably way too busy for that kind of thing!","nextNodeIds":[760090511]},{"nodeId":760090511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1747827730,"text":"So... what does your premonition tell you to do?","nextNodeIds":[760090512]},{"nodeId":760090512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21839,"speakerName":"Kasha","textMapHash":2784759130,"text":"Hmm... For example, that we should put this stone back there?","nextNodeIds":[760090513]},{"nodeId":760090513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21839,"speakerName":"Kasha","textMapHash":2528419114,"text":"#I know I'm not a kid anymore, but I still need to grow a bit to reach that high. Could you give me a hand, {NICKNAME}?","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7600905,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BF